 mystery. As you progress, you'll encounter mechanics that challenge your wit, each puzzle a piece of a larger, enigmatic narrative.<br>Prepare for a journey of discovery and introspection, where every event is a unique encounter, and each solution leads to deeper revelations. Whether through haunting narrations or evocative poetry, Necrophosis weaves a slow burn of intrigue, drawing you into its captivating tale with every twist and turn.","developers":["Dragonis Ares","Adonis Brosteanu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019760/c6c9f6b58bd39bcb23cf0fd3d657505fa832a553/header.jpg?t=1761477230","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2019760/869382/fb6bc8a320a1674b9d3928e948bd6ff87b2181f2/1750744918/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744638931","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2019760/869382/fb6bc8a320a1674b9d3928e948bd6ff87b2181f2/1750744918/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744638931","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2019760/869382/fb6bc8a320a1674b9d3928e948bd6ff87b2181f2/1750744918/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744638931","id":257125585,"name":"Necrophosis Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125585/2159f5545527b2dfc4618898588993428c5e8160/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744638931"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2019760/693477/b41fe6577fa0c049fe712739a6009fddb6871744/1750744914/dash_av1.mpd?t=1714387301","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2019760/693477/b41fe6577fa0c049fe712739a6009fddb6871744/1750744914/dash_h264.mpd?t=1714387301","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2019760/693477/b41fe6577fa0c049fe712739a60